{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/d0f49790ae1b9f11564f03371b0b77cc.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/91002bfb12654db3175a275828c66291.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/91002bfb12654db3175a275828c66291.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/91002bfb12654db3175a275828c66291.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tank Havoc, chaotic mayhem meets precision control -\u00a0battle with or against players in adrenaline-fueled PvP,\u00a0join forces in co-op or play solo to crush your enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>With responsive controls and tactical depth, every match is a test of skill and teamwork.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/d711863fe5535e7860861c626959e719.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1b72fe4feb13c9100287bca4d57cc6f2.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1b72fe4feb13c9100287bca4d57cc6f2.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1b72fe4feb13c9100287bca4d57cc6f2.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tank Havoc</i> drops players into a world where wild nature collides with ancient high-tech civilizations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome tells a story - from rocky battlegrounds scarred by lost civilizations to serene landscapes hiding deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It\u2019s a world of contrast, built for discovery, strategy, and explosive confrontation.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/08a42a9a1ce667caa9d74288b106a40f.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is a playground of destruction and opportunity - built to look great and play even better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar across the battlefield with jump pads, slip through underground tunnels for the perfect flank, or bait enemies into deadly traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every move can change the tide - think fast, act smarter.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/8326a9fab836197fcba059158fe54546.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good positioning can turn a single shot into a match-winning strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain fire from high ground for extra damage, vanish into foliage for a deadly ambush, or take command of turrets to lock down key zones. Every inch of the battlefield can be used to your advantage - if you know how.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>It\u2019s a battlefield where knowledge becomes power.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/0a6dead7c013073897d65692186ee90c.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock visual upgrades and gameplay-enhancing features as you progress. From skins and flags to performance-affecting enhancements, your tanks evolve with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand out from the crowd - let your presence speak long before you pull the trigger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/c65b32d11ca1394d2b08c45c57d42d0c.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the tanks in Tank Havoc comes armed with a unique arsenal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From heavy bursts to piercing beams or rapid-fire salvos, each vehicle handles differently - and each packs a tactical ability that can turn the tide when timed right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose your machine, master its power.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/166a4173ba0b356cfd0211106baa90d9.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/6be4bc3127d45c29ec824e9314dfe15b.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/6be4bc3127d45c29ec824e9314dfe15b.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/6be4bc3127d45c29ec824e9314dfe15b.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression in Tank Havoc goes beyond unlocks - it\u2019s about shaping how you play. Earn experience, unlock tools, and develop tactical depth over time. The more you fight, the more flexible and dangerous you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It\u2019s a system that evolves as fast as you do.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1c0eac1c54fa32e074f137103f8483ce.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/2aff276f605af23e426018f240a4b926.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank Havoc never locks you into a single role. Lead the charge, hold the line, or stalk your prey from the shadows - every playstyle has its place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your operator, craft your loadout, and let the battlefield become a reflection of your strategy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No playstyle is off limits - only your skill sets the pace.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846960?t=1774594713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/f0e63f8a9013d58db79d830f002d36476f2dddca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774594713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/f14ec6a42f13858357fc89313075642d347a503b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774594713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/f14ec6a42f13858357fc89313075642d347a503b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774594713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/d0f49790ae1b9f11564f03371b0b77cc.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/91002bfb12654db3175a275828c66291.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/91002bfb12654db3175a275828c66291.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/91002bfb12654db3175a275828c66291.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tank Havoc, chaotic mayhem meets precision control -\u00a0battle with or against players in adrenaline-fueled PvP,\u00a0join forces in co-op or play solo to crush your enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>With responsive controls and tactical depth, every match is a test of skill and teamwork.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/d711863fe5535e7860861c626959e719.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1b72fe4feb13c9100287bca4d57cc6f2.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1b72fe4feb13c9100287bca4d57cc6f2.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1b72fe4feb13c9100287bca4d57cc6f2.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tank Havoc</i> drops players into a world where wild nature collides with ancient high-tech civilizations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome tells a story - from rocky battlegrounds scarred by lost civilizations to serene landscapes hiding deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It\u2019s a world of contrast, built for discovery, strategy, and explosive confrontation.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/08a42a9a1ce667caa9d74288b106a40f.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/fde6d76e704cecb409b48b7592a8a9bf.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is a playground of destruction and opportunity - built to look great and play even better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar across the battlefield with jump pads, slip through underground tunnels for the perfect flank, or bait enemies into deadly traps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every move can change the tide - think fast, act smarter.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/8326a9fab836197fcba059158fe54546.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/ca633e29ac85d170ad219b421e1dad4c.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good positioning can turn a single shot into a match-winning strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain fire from high ground for extra damage, vanish into foliage for a deadly ambush, or take command of turrets to lock down key zones. Every inch of the battlefield can be used to your advantage - if you know how.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>It\u2019s a battlefield where knowledge becomes power.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/0a6dead7c013073897d65692186ee90c.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/246d690a8755f574f19ab438260bd992.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock visual upgrades and gameplay-enhancing features as you progress. From skins and flags to performance-affecting enhancements, your tanks evolve with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stand out from the crowd - let your presence speak long before you pull the trigger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/c65b32d11ca1394d2b08c45c57d42d0c.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/3da21c235da9331c28449df6bc8eb8c1.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the tanks in Tank Havoc comes armed with a unique arsenal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From heavy bursts to piercing beams or rapid-fire salvos, each vehicle handles differently - and each packs a tactical ability that can turn the tide when timed right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose your machine, master its power.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/166a4173ba0b356cfd0211106baa90d9.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/6be4bc3127d45c29ec824e9314dfe15b.poster.avif?t=1774594713\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/6be4bc3127d45c29ec824e9314dfe15b.webm?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/6be4bc3127d45c29ec824e9314dfe15b.mp4?t=1774594713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression in Tank Havoc goes beyond unlocks - it\u2019s about shaping how you play. Earn experience, unlock tools, and develop tactical depth over time. The more you fight, the more flexible and dangerous you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>It\u2019s a system that evolves as fast as you do.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/41609e64d181c9468f822277846a3338.webp?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/1c0eac1c54fa32e074f137103f8483ce.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/extras/2aff276f605af23e426018f240a4b926.avif?t=1774594713\" width=1560 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank Havoc never locks you into a single role. Lead the charge, hold the line, or stalk your prey from the shadows - every playstyle has its place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your operator, craft your loadout, and let the battlefield become a reflection of your strategy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No playstyle is off limits - only your skill sets the pace.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mad Missile"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846960/c2a2f1fe20fb4b861dc003c32c16547e29de6629/header.jpg?t=1774594713","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846960/1280830191/5e4fa0b05c9b5b4dc6e2ac5797986dd8233ca28d/1758303265/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758308066","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846960/1280830191/5e4fa0b05c9b5b4dc6e2ac5797986dd8233ca28d/1758303265/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758308066","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846960/1280830191/5e4fa0b05c9b5b4dc6e2ac5797986dd8233ca28d/1758303265/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758308066","id":257169066,"name":"Trailer_01","thumbnail":"https